<section class="q4u-section q4u-process-section"
         id="how-it-works">

    <div class="container q4u-container">

        <div class="q4u-section-heading">
            <span class="q4u-eyebrow">
                SIMPLE BY DESIGN
            </span>

            <h2>
                From paperwork to
                <span>peace of mind.</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                The digital experience is being designed around the same Q4U
                service customers already know, with less unnecessary effort.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="q4u-process-grid">

            <div class="q4u-process-card">
                <span class="q4u-process-number">
                    01
                </span>

                <div class="q4u-process-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                         aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10 5 5 0 0 1 0-10Zm0 2a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6ZM4 22v-3c0-3.3 3.6-5 8-5s8 1.7 8 5v3h-2v-3c0-1.7-2.3-3-6-3s-6 1.3-6 3v3H4Z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h3>Create your profile</h3>

                <p>
                    Keep your details and vehicles organised under one secure
                    customer profile.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-line">
                <span>→</span>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-card">
                <span class="q4u-process-number">
                    02
                </span>

                <div class="q4u-process-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                         aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M4 2h11l5 5v15H4V2Zm2 2v16h12V8h-4V4H6Zm10 .8V6h1.2L16 4.8ZM8 11h8v2H8v-2Zm0 4h8v2H8v-2Z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h3>Add your documents</h3>

                <p>
                    Bring the paperwork associated with your vehicle into a
                    clearer digital record.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-line">
                <span>→</span>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-card">
                <span class="q4u-process-number">
                    03
                </span>

                <div class="q4u-process-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                         aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 22a10 10 0 1 1 10-10 10 10 0 0 1-10 10Zm0-18a8 8 0 1 0 8 8 8 8 0 0 0-8-8Zm1 3v4.6l3.3 2-1 1.7-4.3-2.6V7h2Z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h3>Stay ahead</h3>

                <p>
                    See what is coming up and receive reminders before
                    important vehicle dates are missed.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-line">
                <span>→</span>
            </div>

            <div class="q4u-process-card">
                <span class="q4u-process-number">
                    04
                </span>

                <div class="q4u-process-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                         aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="m9.2 16.2-4.4-4.4 1.4-1.4 3 3 8.6-8.6 1.4 1.4-10 10Z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h3>Let Q4U assist</h3>

                <p>
                    Request the service you need and follow the process through
                    a simple, understandable journey.
                </p>
            </div>

